Makes a deny's bump stamp one past the local record's stamp, or 1 with no
local record, as before 1088173 (§7.1, §8.2): `FolderState::deny` no
longer passes the largest quarantined stamp at the path to
`Index::bump_over`. The bump still dominates every quarantined version
but can rank below one of them, so a node that meets the bump alone and a
node holding the dominated version rank differently and I7 fails.

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_deny_ranks_above_every_version_it_dominates

